"{\"action\": \"final\", \"answer\": \"To claim travel expenses for a business trip to London, follow these steps: \\n1. Book flights within the specified class (Premium economy class for international short-haul flights).\\n2. Reasonable costs associated with ground transportation will be reimbursed.\\n3. For accommodation, since London is considered a high-cost city, you can claim expenses up to USD 150 per night. However, if the cost exceeds this amount, you may request an exception from the Travel Manager.\\n4. Submit all receipts for expenses exceeding USD 100 along with your expense claim.\", \"sources\": [\"expenses.pdf\"]}"